      "formation_structure": {
        "clearance": "12F RIGHT at [2,5], Lava RIGHT at [5,5], Durin LEFT at [2,3], and GALLUS² LEFT at [5,3] cover the four devices.",
        "healing": "Lancet-2 supplies the opening global heal and temporary lower healing. Hibiscus covers both upper holds and eastern attackers. Ansel DOWN covers the lower central hold, Lava's eventual lower tile, the upper central hold and eastern Steward; upper outer Melantha remains Hibiscus's responsibility.",
        "late_combat": "Spot blocks three upper central enemies without unsupported healing. Midnight holds lower central, Melantha upper outer and Beagle lower outer. 12F then Steward supply upper Arts; Lava supplies lower Arts.",
        "opening": "Fang and Vanilla hold central routes; Melantha holds upper outer; Friston-3 holds lower outer until Beagle replaces him.",
        "patrol": "Steward UP covers both eastern waits. GALLUS² UP adds upper eastern and vertical-pass damage. Lava LEFT and Durin RIGHT cover the final western wait."
      },
